// GTW-437 SAMPLE weighting for the LeftArm; GTW-443 references the hand-disabling
// injury so it can be rolled on a Major left-arm wound. The full >=6-entries-per-
// severity content floor is GTW-440 — empty buckets are valid (they build no table; the
// GTW-438 roll then finds no table and inflicts no injury). `injury:` is an InjuryName
// KEY (the `.injury.ron` file stem); an unknown key WARNs + is skipped at table-build.
// Authored order does NOT affect determinism (entries are canonically sorted at build).
(
    body_part: LeftArm,                                            // the part this table weights
    minor:    [],                                                  // Minor bucket    (GTW-440 fills the floor)
    major:    [ (injury: "shattered_left_hand", weight: 6) ],      // GTW-443 hand-disable + 1H aim penalty
    critical: [],                                                  // Critical bucket (GTW-440 fills the floor)
)
